WEBVTT

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:39.120
Wake up, Hoshitani!

00:00:39.120 --> 00:00:42.410
You have cleaning duty for
the lesson room today, don't you?

00:00:42.410 --> 00:00:44.410
Come on!

00:00:44.410 --> 00:00:46.450
I said, come on!

00:00:51.040 --> 00:00:53.370
Wow, that's so fancy!

00:00:53.370 --> 00:00:55.040
Did you make them, Nayuki?

00:00:55.040 --> 00:00:56.790
Uh, yeah...

00:00:56.790 --> 00:01:01.500
I like cooking, so I thought
I'd try making boxed lunches.

00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:02.750
Wow...

00:01:02.750 --> 00:01:06.250
I made some for you, too, Hoshitani...

00:01:06.250 --> 00:01:07.870
Is that a problem...?

00:01:07.870 --> 00:01:09.040
It's delicious!

00:01:09.040 --> 00:01:12.330
Wow, Nayuki, you're a genius at cooking!

00:01:12.330 --> 00:01:13.450
Y-You think so?

00:01:13.450 --> 00:01:16.950
Wait, Hoshitani! Look at what time it is!

00:01:18.830 --> 00:01:21.200
Crap, I forgot!

00:01:21.200 --> 00:01:24.330
Oh, Hoshitani, your lunch!

00:01:29.120 --> 00:01:32.700
Stop sulking... Come closer...

00:01:32.700 --> 00:01:36.580
Don't worry, I'll be gentle.

00:01:36.580 --> 00:01:39.830
"Kakeru Tengenji

00:01:36.580 --> 00:01:39.830
Unless you want me to be rough?

00:01:44.500 --> 00:01:47.200
Tengenji...

00:01:49.370 --> 00:01:51.540
Woah.

00:01:53.700 --> 00:01:55.040
Kuga?

00:01:55.040 --> 00:01:57.330
You went out already this morning?

00:01:57.330 --> 00:01:59.450
Don't be late for class!

00:02:02.080 --> 00:02:03.870
Class B, Shinya Tanioka.

00:02:03.870 --> 00:02:04.700
Here.

00:02:04.700 --> 00:02:06.450
Class C, Shoji Sato.

00:02:06.450 --> 00:02:07.500
Here.

00:02:07.500 --> 00:02:08.790
Class A, Hoshitani--

00:02:08.790 --> 00:02:12.250
Here! I'm here, I'm here, I'm here!

00:02:18.870 --> 00:02:22.700
Ever since our practices as
musical department candidates started,

00:02:22.700 --> 00:02:24.910
I've realized something.

00:02:24.910 --> 00:02:26.500
"Kakeru Tengenji" "Toru Nayuki" "Yuta Hoshitani"
"Sho Kuga" "Kaito Tsukigami"

00:02:26.500 --> 00:02:28.950
I'm still nowhere near where I should be.

00:02:28.950 --> 00:02:32.290
I have to practice more and more.

00:02:32.290 --> 00:02:37.000
I need to catch up to everyone else fast
and get into the musical department.

00:02:37.000 --> 00:02:41.410
I'm going to stand on stage
with that high schooler I admire!

00:02:48.830 --> 00:02:52.410
<i>D-R-E-A-M-E-R, Dreamer</i>

00:02:52.410 --> 00:02:59.790
<i>Clicking my heels on the pavement after the rain</i>

00:02:59.790 --> 00:03:06.910
<i>With light steps,</i>
<i>in high spirits, my heart leaps</i>

00:03:06.910 --> 00:03:14.750
<i>"Purely, delightfully, humorously"</i>

00:03:14.750 --> 00:03:16.250
<i>Wow oh Wow oh</i>

00:03:16.250 --> 00:03:22.790
<i>That's my motto</i>

00:03:22.790 --> 00:03:31.040
<i>If I'm going to move forward without</i>
<i>doing anything and break into pieces</i>

00:03:31.040 --> 00:03:37.290
<i>Then I'll go for broke, I won't look back</i>

00:03:37.290 --> 00:03:38.330
<i>Go! Go!</i>

00:03:38.330 --> 00:03:45.830
<i>If I just keep looking at it,</i>
<i>my dream will remain a dream</i>

00:03:45.830 --> 00:03:49.540
<i>I don't want to give up,</i>
<i>don't want to have regrets</i>

00:03:49.540 --> 00:03:55.290
<i>I don't know how, but it's not impossible</i>

00:03:55.290 --> 00:04:00.290
<i>I'm a Dreamer.</i>

00:04:00.290 --> 00:04:00.950
"STARMYU"
<i>I'm a Dreamer.</i>

00:04:00.950 --> 00:04:04.500
"STARMYU"
<i>D-R-E-A-M-E-R, Dreamer</i>

00:04:08.290 --> 00:04:12.000
<i>D-R-E-A-M-E-R, Dreamer</i>

00:04:13.830 --> 00:04:15.750
Here's your lunch.

00:04:15.750 --> 00:04:17.200
"Act 3"

00:04:15.750 --> 00:04:17.200
Thanks.

00:04:17.200 --> 00:04:19.700
Did you make it in time for cleaning duty?

00:04:19.700 --> 00:04:21.910
Yeah, thanks...

00:04:21.910 --> 00:04:24.700
Wait, you're eating it now? Here?

00:04:24.700 --> 00:04:29.080
I didn't eat breakfast,
so I'll just have a little--

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:32.410
Huh? Did you drop it?

00:04:32.410 --> 00:04:36.250
Oh, I forgot! You see, Tengenji...

00:04:36.250 --> 00:04:37.160
Tengenji...?

00:04:37.160 --> 00:04:39.120
Never mind.

00:04:39.660 --> 00:04:42.040
It's the great Kakeru!

00:04:39.660 --> 00:04:42.040
He's so dreamy!

00:04:48.580 --> 00:04:50.660
Tengenji...

00:04:50.660 --> 00:04:53.620
He's so popular.

00:04:53.620 --> 00:04:55.660
He's conceited.

00:04:55.660 --> 00:04:57.290
Tsukigami?

00:04:58.250 --> 00:05:04.120
Guys like him have no mercy for
those who hurt their pride or honor.

00:05:04.700 --> 00:05:07.290
You should be careful.

00:05:08.660 --> 00:05:10.120
I wonder what he meant?

00:05:10.120 --> 00:05:11.700
Who knows?

00:05:36.700 --> 00:05:38.750
Tengenji!

00:05:41.750 --> 00:05:43.040
Tengenji?

00:05:43.040 --> 00:05:47.370
I thought I told you not to speak
to me so familiarly, you boor.

00:05:47.370 --> 00:05:51.950
I'm passing on the cleaning duty chart.
Tengenji, it's your turn next, right?

00:05:59.830 --> 00:06:01.750
Pick it up.

00:06:01.750 --> 00:06:03.750
Didn't you hear me?

00:06:03.750 --> 00:06:06.080
I said, pick it up.

00:06:08.700 --> 00:06:15.080
If you can't be useful to the team,
at least be an attentive assistant, you amateur.

00:06:17.330 --> 00:06:19.950
I can't do that.

00:06:19.950 --> 00:06:21.620
What did you say?

00:06:21.620 --> 00:06:24.790
I know that I'm not good enough.

00:06:24.790 --> 00:06:28.290
But I can't become an assistant.

00:06:32.290 --> 00:06:35.120
At this point, he's way below the rest of us.

00:06:35.120 --> 00:06:40.080
We would have a better chance of surviving
if we got rid of him to form a four-person group.

00:06:45.620 --> 00:06:47.580
What's so funny?

00:06:47.580 --> 00:06:50.370
I like people who are honest.

00:06:50.370 --> 00:06:54.580
But we're not changing the members. Okay?

00:07:04.120 --> 00:07:07.250
Hoshitani! T-Tengenji, you too...

00:07:07.250 --> 00:07:10.370
Calm down, both of you. Okay? Okay?

00:07:10.370 --> 00:07:13.870
I carry the future of the <i>kabuki</i> world.

00:07:15.040 --> 00:07:17.660
I did not come to Ayanagi to play.

00:07:17.660 --> 00:07:22.120
There's no way I'll accept
failing because of an amateur!

00:07:22.120 --> 00:07:23.950
You boor.

00:07:23.950 --> 00:07:27.790
If you know how bad you are,
then quit the team.

00:07:29.160 --> 00:07:30.950
T-Tengenji!

00:07:30.950 --> 00:07:35.540
You're joking, right? Hoshitani,
don't take him seriously. Okay? Okay?

00:07:35.540 --> 00:07:36.750
I'll think about it.

00:07:36.750 --> 00:07:38.040
What?

00:07:41.120 --> 00:07:42.500
Hoshitani!

00:07:42.500 --> 00:07:45.580
You weren't serious about
what you said earlier, were you?

00:07:45.580 --> 00:07:48.250
About quitting the team?

00:07:48.250 --> 00:07:49.870
Hoshitani...

00:07:49.870 --> 00:07:52.700
I understand how Tengenji feels now.

00:07:52.700 --> 00:07:55.830
He's serious about this, too.

00:07:55.830 --> 00:07:57.700
I wonder...

00:07:57.700 --> 00:08:02.040
Tengenji might've just enrolled
in this school because of his family.

00:08:02.040 --> 00:08:04.120
Besides, there are rumors that every night,

00:08:04.120 --> 00:08:06.830
he brings a girl to his room and
whispers sweet nothings to her.

00:08:06.830 --> 00:08:08.120
Sweet nothings?

00:08:08.120 --> 00:08:12.040
And even this morning,
from Tengenji's room came...

00:08:12.040 --> 00:08:14.500
I'll be gentle.

00:08:14.500 --> 00:08:18.790
Unless you want me to be rough?

00:08:21.080 --> 00:08:22.750
What's wrong?

00:08:22.750 --> 00:08:26.370
A-Anyway, it's questionable
whether he's serious or not!

00:08:28.160 --> 00:08:30.950
I'm going to try trusting my gut.

00:08:30.950 --> 00:08:32.830
Huh? Your gut?

00:08:32.830 --> 00:08:34.830
What do you mean...?

00:08:34.830 --> 00:08:37.870
Hoshitani!

00:08:37.870 --> 00:08:41.580
Don't go too wild, lover boy.

00:08:41.580 --> 00:08:44.250
Your woman wears too much perfume.

00:08:44.250 --> 00:08:45.750
Make her bring her own helmet.

00:08:45.750 --> 00:08:48.660
Shu, this is your precious motorcycle, right?

00:08:48.660 --> 00:08:50.950
Don't just use it to take you to and from work--

00:08:50.950 --> 00:08:55.580
Put a girl on it once in a while,
you workaholic boy.

00:08:55.580 --> 00:09:00.450
Well? How is it, being on the loser Star Team?

00:09:00.450 --> 00:09:04.790
With your abilities, I thought
you'd be on the same team as me.

00:09:04.790 --> 00:09:11.660
There are rumors, you know, about how
Otori gathered guys who should've failed.

00:09:14.120 --> 00:09:15.580
I see.

00:09:16.910 --> 00:09:21.040
No wonder it's full of weird people.

00:09:25.580 --> 00:09:29.080
That's unexpected.

00:09:29.080 --> 00:09:31.700
I didn't think you had friends.

00:09:31.700 --> 00:09:35.910
He's on the Star Team of Hiragi,
the head of the Kao Council.

00:09:38.040 --> 00:09:40.500
Does that bother you?

00:09:40.500 --> 00:09:41.830
Not really.

00:10:01.580 --> 00:10:03.620
What's wrong, boys?

00:10:03.620 --> 00:10:08.500
You're feelings are even more
disconnected than usual today.

00:10:08.500 --> 00:10:10.330
Listen.

00:10:10.330 --> 00:10:14.410
What's important in musicals is teamwork.

00:10:14.410 --> 00:10:17.410
Even if you're all good individually,
if your feelings aren't one,

00:10:17.410 --> 00:10:20.330
then you'll just be making noise.

00:10:20.330 --> 00:10:24.290
Why should I match
someone who is inferior to me?

00:10:24.290 --> 00:10:27.410
There's no way I'd accept that!

00:10:27.410 --> 00:10:29.290
I won't do it!

00:10:32.160 --> 00:10:34.700
It's not that you <i>won't</i> do it,
but that you <i>can't</i> , right?

00:10:34.700 --> 00:10:35.910
What?

00:10:35.910 --> 00:10:38.040
You can't cooperate--

00:10:38.040 --> 00:10:43.910
It must be too hard for a
rich boy who grew up pampered.

00:10:46.200 --> 00:10:48.620
Is that all you wanted to say?

00:10:50.870 --> 00:10:56.080
♪ Running across the stage forever ♪

00:10:56.080 --> 00:11:01.370
♪ The passion I give off in the moment ♪

00:11:01.370 --> 00:11:06.540
♪ Thinking of the gorgeous night ♪

00:11:06.540 --> 00:11:10.830
♪ Bloom proudly now, dazzling ♪

00:11:10.830 --> 00:11:15.290
♪ You flowers of the world ♪

00:11:23.830 --> 00:11:26.330
♪ Choosing the never-ending present ♪

00:11:26.330 --> 00:11:29.120
♪ Carrying destiny ♪

00:11:29.120 --> 00:11:34.200
♪ Make the gales of time your ally ♪

00:11:34.200 --> 00:11:36.870
♪ Under the dark gray skies ♪

00:11:36.870 --> 00:11:39.660
♪ Can't even harbor ambitions ♪

00:11:39.660 --> 00:11:43.580
♪ You boors should just disappear ♪

00:11:43.580 --> 00:11:49.910
♪ If the refined moon
just past full is on the stage ♪

00:11:49.910 --> 00:11:56.790
♪ Then the truth will live
tucked away in my heart... ♪

00:11:56.790 --> 00:12:02.080
♪ The context of thousands of dreams ♪

00:12:02.080 --> 00:12:07.290
♪ The ephemerally shining shadows of stars ♪

00:12:07.290 --> 00:12:12.450
♪ I'll live desperately in this transient world ♪

00:12:12.450 --> 00:12:16.790
♪ Dyeing my heart crimson ♪

00:12:16.790 --> 00:12:20.910
♪ You flowers of the world ♪

00:12:36.450 --> 00:12:42.870
Anyway, the goal for the
test stage is to not be cut.

00:12:42.870 --> 00:12:46.160
Just take it easy and
work with that goal in mind.

00:12:54.370 --> 00:12:55.410
"Last place at the Newcomers' Debut Performance will be Team Otori,
don't you think?" "Team Hiragi will definitely be first!!!"

00:12:55.410 --> 00:12:59.580
Your team seems very popular.

00:12:59.580 --> 00:13:02.910
Well, they're an unexpected group.

00:13:02.910 --> 00:13:06.370
If you're going to quit, now's the time.

00:13:06.370 --> 00:13:08.200
I won't quit.

00:13:08.200 --> 00:13:10.870
I'll stick to my own way of doing things.

00:13:15.000 --> 00:13:16.410
Tengenji!

00:13:19.410 --> 00:13:22.200
Hey! I wanna talk to you, Tengenji!

00:13:22.200 --> 00:13:24.250
Be quiet, you boor!

00:13:24.250 --> 00:13:26.790
Don't talk so loud! You'll scare her!

00:13:26.790 --> 00:13:28.370
Is someone there?

00:13:28.370 --> 00:13:29.750
What do you want?

00:13:29.750 --> 00:13:32.080
Oh, I was thinking it over...

00:13:33.580 --> 00:13:36.370
And I understand how you feel, Tengenji.

00:13:36.370 --> 00:13:38.370
I understand that you're serious, too.

00:13:38.370 --> 00:13:40.330
Oh?

00:13:40.330 --> 00:13:43.330
I'm holding you back, huh.

00:13:43.330 --> 00:13:46.910
I apologize for that. Sorry.

00:13:46.910 --> 00:13:48.500
If you understand, then...

00:13:48.500 --> 00:13:51.660
But I won't quit the team.

00:13:53.330 --> 00:13:57.290
I have a dream, so I'm serious about this, too.

00:13:57.290 --> 00:14:00.370
That's why... Tengenji...

00:14:02.910 --> 00:14:05.450
Be my friend!

00:14:10.700 --> 00:14:13.160
I can't believe...

00:14:13.160 --> 00:14:17.040
Jeez, how did that
thought even cross your mind?

00:14:17.040 --> 00:14:18.200
I can't take it anymore.

00:14:18.200 --> 00:14:19.370
Wait!

00:14:19.370 --> 00:14:20.700
Did I say something weird?

00:14:20.700 --> 00:14:21.660
Let go!

00:14:21.660 --> 00:14:23.040
Wai-- Tengenji!

00:14:23.040 --> 00:14:25.040
Just let me go!

00:14:40.080 --> 00:14:41.500
Tavian?

00:14:42.500 --> 00:14:44.080
Tavian!

00:14:49.580 --> 00:14:53.120
Oh, sorry... I'm bad with cats...

00:14:53.120 --> 00:14:54.660
You little--!

00:14:54.660 --> 00:14:58.290
Tavian hasn't set a paw outside since she was born!

00:14:58.290 --> 00:15:00.700
What'll you do if something happens to her?!

00:15:01.620 --> 00:15:04.580
If something happens to her... I'll...

00:15:30.160 --> 00:15:31.660
Tavian...

00:15:34.330 --> 00:15:36.500
Tavineow!

00:15:45.160 --> 00:15:47.160
Hoshitani?

00:15:47.160 --> 00:15:49.160
No luck here, either.

00:15:49.160 --> 00:15:51.830
Do you know anything
other than the name and color?

00:15:51.830 --> 00:15:53.790
The breed, or something?

00:15:53.790 --> 00:15:56.870
Sorry... I don't really know...

00:15:56.870 --> 00:15:58.790
I'm bad with cats...

00:15:58.790 --> 00:16:00.200
Huh? Really?

00:16:00.200 --> 00:16:02.540
Sorry, thanks for helping.

00:16:07.200 --> 00:16:08.620
Tavian!

00:16:20.950 --> 00:16:23.450
I wonder where Tavian went...?

00:16:23.450 --> 00:16:28.750
♪ I want to hold you in my arms ♪

00:16:28.750 --> 00:16:33.160
♪ You are a cute angel ♪

00:16:33.160 --> 00:16:35.790
♪ I miss you ♪

00:16:35.790 --> 00:16:40.950
♪ I don't mind falling in
love if this is what love is ♪

00:16:40.950 --> 00:16:48.410
♪ Stay by my side forever ♪

00:16:58.660 --> 00:17:00.750
Nayuki!

00:17:00.750 --> 00:17:02.700
Hoshitani!

00:17:02.700 --> 00:17:04.790
Did you find it?

00:17:04.790 --> 00:17:06.500
Oh...

00:17:06.500 --> 00:17:09.080
Hoshitani, you're bad with cats, right?

00:17:09.080 --> 00:17:11.950
I'll take care of the res--

00:17:09.080 --> 00:17:11.950
That cat...

00:17:11.950 --> 00:17:15.620
To Tengenji, that cat was
his irreplaceable friend.

00:17:15.620 --> 00:17:18.330
But I...

00:17:18.330 --> 00:17:20.000
Hoshitani...

00:17:26.870 --> 00:17:28.540
Tavian....

00:17:38.370 --> 00:17:40.080
Tavian!

00:17:41.660 --> 00:17:43.790
Tavian!

00:17:54.040 --> 00:17:56.040
"Golden Spoon" "Cat Medicine"
"Silver Soup Base" "Fish Soup"

00:17:58.160 --> 00:18:00.330
I was so worried.

00:18:00.330 --> 00:18:04.330
If you hadn't come back, I...

00:18:05.540 --> 00:18:06.870
I would've been alone.

00:18:08.870 --> 00:18:11.790
Oh, you're so cute! Jeez!

00:18:11.790 --> 00:18:14.040
Oh, no.

00:18:14.040 --> 00:18:16.160
Sorry.

00:18:16.160 --> 00:18:18.410
I have cleaning duty today.

00:18:18.410 --> 00:18:20.870
I'll play with you a ton when I get back.

00:18:23.870 --> 00:18:26.200
Be good and wait for me.

00:18:41.500 --> 00:18:43.500
Your cat...

00:18:43.500 --> 00:18:46.250
Are you trying to say I'm breaking the rules?

00:18:46.250 --> 00:18:48.500
You found it?

00:18:48.500 --> 00:18:53.580
Earlier, Hoshitani and Nayuki said
they were looking for it at the park.

00:18:53.580 --> 00:18:55.080
What?!

00:18:57.580 --> 00:18:58.660
Did you find it?

00:18:58.660 --> 00:18:59.910
No...

00:18:59.910 --> 00:19:04.830
You can go back first.
I'll look a little longer.

00:19:04.830 --> 00:19:06.370
You guys!

00:19:09.370 --> 00:19:10.950
Tengenji?

00:19:12.950 --> 00:19:15.040
What are you doing?

00:19:15.040 --> 00:19:17.750
Sorry! I haven't found it yet!

00:19:18.950 --> 00:19:20.950
But I'll definitely find it!

00:19:20.950 --> 00:19:25.950
I'll find your precious friend no matter what!

00:19:25.950 --> 00:19:28.450
I'm really sorry.

00:19:32.540 --> 00:19:33.200
Drink up.

00:19:33.200 --> 00:19:34.120
Thanks.

00:19:34.120 --> 00:19:35.450
Thank you.

00:19:37.830 --> 00:19:40.160
That hits the spot!

00:19:40.160 --> 00:19:44.700
I see. You found Tavian, huh?

00:19:44.700 --> 00:19:47.620
I'm glad.

00:19:47.620 --> 00:19:51.000
You two really are boors.

00:19:51.750 --> 00:19:56.500
Speaking of which, it wasn't a girl, was it?

00:19:56.500 --> 00:19:59.950
Well, about how every night
you whisper sweet nothings--

00:19:59.950 --> 00:20:05.080
More importantly, I want to know
why you don't like cats, Hoshitani.

00:20:05.080 --> 00:20:06.660
Yeah, why do you hate the angels?

00:20:06.660 --> 00:20:08.000
Yeah!

00:20:09.250 --> 00:20:12.950
Well, actually...

00:20:12.950 --> 00:20:14.950
Is it something too sad to remember?

00:20:14.950 --> 00:20:17.080
S-Sorry...

00:20:19.330 --> 00:20:22.450
When I was little, my dad bought...

00:20:22.450 --> 00:20:24.160
...a cat...

00:20:24.160 --> 00:20:25.370
...shaped decoration...

00:20:25.370 --> 00:20:27.370
And it was super scary!

00:20:27.370 --> 00:20:29.950
And pretty big!

00:20:32.200 --> 00:20:36.160
That was so traumatic that even now, cats are...

00:20:40.500 --> 00:20:46.330
Now, before school starts,
I've gotta do yesterday's training, too.

00:20:46.330 --> 00:20:47.500
Training?

00:20:47.500 --> 00:20:50.200
Yeah, he does it every day.

00:20:50.200 --> 00:20:53.000
I practice basic steps and turns.

00:20:53.000 --> 00:20:55.870
I'm especially bad at consecutive turns.

00:20:55.870 --> 00:20:59.000
I'm almost there, though.

00:20:59.000 --> 00:21:03.580
Empty your mind and just look forward.

00:21:03.580 --> 00:21:05.910
Like this.

00:21:11.660 --> 00:21:14.750
Wow, you really are amazing, Tengenji.

00:21:14.750 --> 00:21:17.790
I'll teach you one more thing, Hoshitani.

00:21:17.790 --> 00:21:19.830
Don't let your failures show in your face.

00:21:22.700 --> 00:21:25.870
On stage, you should face forward boldly.

00:21:25.870 --> 00:21:30.620
That should be easy for someone
naive and overly positive, like you.

00:21:30.620 --> 00:21:32.250
Tengenji!

00:21:32.250 --> 00:21:34.410
D-Don't get the wrong idea!

00:21:34.410 --> 00:21:37.370
If you're going to be on my team,
you should have the minimum preparation--

00:21:37.370 --> 00:21:39.790
Thanks, Tengenji!

00:21:39.790 --> 00:21:42.750
I don't care what you think. You're my friend!

00:21:42.750 --> 00:21:43.950
Stop it! That's gross!

00:21:43.950 --> 00:21:46.080
It's fine! 'Cause I'm happy!

00:21:46.080 --> 00:21:48.250
Let go!

00:21:46.080 --> 00:21:48.250
I feel like we're forgetting something...

00:21:48.250 --> 00:21:50.160
I won't let go!

00:21:50.160 --> 00:21:53.950
Get away! Your face is too close!

00:22:03.500 --> 00:22:10.660
<i>Someday, when you're crushed by your dreams</i>

00:22:10.660 --> 00:22:17.160
<i>On a night when you look up at a starless sky</i>

00:22:17.160 --> 00:22:20.660
<i>Just remember (today)</i>

00:22:20.660 --> 00:22:25.000
<i>The days we ran like crazy (together)</i>

00:22:25.000 --> 00:22:29.120
<i>Those steps were miracles</i>

00:22:29.120 --> 00:22:32.370
<i>Ring out, Countdown!</i>

00:22:32.370 --> 00:22:35.950
<i>Taking off for the future from here</i>

00:22:35.950 --> 00:22:39.910
<i>You will start singing again</i>

00:22:39.910 --> 00:22:43.080
<i>There are things you lack</i>

00:22:43.080 --> 00:22:46.950
<i>So you reach out desperately to grab them</i>

00:22:46.950 --> 00:22:50.450
<i>These hot, passionate feelings overflowing</i>

00:22:50.450 --> 00:22:54.200
<i>Make the light of the stars your ally</i>

00:22:54.200 --> 00:22:57.750
<i>Even bluffing can become your pride</i>

00:22:57.750 --> 00:23:01.410
<i>You can fly however you want</i>

00:23:01.410 --> 00:23:07.450
<i>Everything starts now!</i>

00:23:20.950 --> 00:23:22.870
Hoshitani!

00:23:22.870 --> 00:23:25.910
Oh yeah, I heard you forgot about cleaning duty.

00:23:25.910 --> 00:23:27.750
Don't say it like you had nothing to do with it!

00:23:27.750 --> 00:23:30.750
Thanks to you, I have to do
penalty duty every morning for a week!

00:23:30.750 --> 00:23:34.000
My precious time with Tavian is...

00:23:34.000 --> 00:23:38.410
Oh, make some time to teach me
cartwheels and dance steps, too!

00:23:38.410 --> 00:23:39.450
You know what?!

00:23:39.450 --> 00:23:40.580
Morning, Tsukigami!

00:23:40.580 --> 00:23:41.830
Hey!

00:23:41.830 --> 00:23:44.330
It looks like you've made another friend.

00:23:44.330 --> 00:23:45.120
Huh?

00:23:45.120 --> 00:23:47.200
I don't care what the other guys do.

00:23:47.200 --> 00:23:51.160
I have no intention of following your pace.

00:23:56.450 --> 00:23:57.830
Hm?

00:23:59.620 --> 00:23:59.910
"Act 4"

00:23:59.910 --> 00:24:02.790
What? I have to do
the preview by myself today?

00:24:02.790 --> 00:24:07.000
Even if I'm famous, you should be
considerate when relying on others.

00:24:07.000 --> 00:24:10.620
Well, if you beg on your knees, the great
me will do the previews for all the episod--

00:24:10.620 --> 00:24:12.870
Now, next week's Mr. STARMYU is--

00:24:12.870 --> 00:24:14.040
You were here?!

00:24:14.120 --> 00:24:29.120
"Otori"
"Don't miss it, you boor."
